1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,033
Does your board know?

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:05,288
<i>Not here. Not now.</i>

3
00:00:05,408 --> 00:00:07,177
Celeste. Hi.

4
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:09,733
You two… know each other?

5
00:00:09,853 --> 00:00:10,467
We dated.

6
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:14,169
He took me to Paris. Answered emails
the whole time.

7
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:16,654
This is cute, though.

8
00:00:16,774 --> 00:00:18,591
<i>She has no idea. Delicious.</i>

9
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:21,211
She called you Hunter Cole.

10
00:00:21,331 --> 00:00:21,900
…That's my name.

11
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:26,955
Like the bank. 'Mr. Cole, did you
authorize…'

12
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:29,358
It's— yeah. It's a family name.

13
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:33,331
<i>Same excuse. Lie number two.</i>

14
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:40,262
Board approved it Sunday. Wave one.
Fourth floor. Your signature by
Friday.

15
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:42,782
I'm not signing it.

16
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:46,596
<i>There it is.</i>

17
00:00:46,716 --> 00:00:49,751
Then the board signs it. With a CEO
who will.

18
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:53,677
Where do you go all day, Hunter?
Fourth floor?

19
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,702
Say hi to Ms. Reyes. Cute photos from
the lake, by the way.

20
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:03,968
<i>He put her on it. By name.</i>

21
00:01:04,650 --> 00:01:11,163
Okay. Everybody's spiraling. Nobody's
getting fired before Friday. So,
Thursday?

22
00:01:11,650 --> 00:01:12,475
We're going out.

23
00:01:13,650 --> 00:01:17,874
Improv. Old Town. Six of us, like ten
bucks each.

24
00:01:18,650 --> 00:01:19,929
Improv? Abby.

25
00:01:20,049 --> 00:01:22,222
<i>Don't let them see your hands shake.</i>

26
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:26,000
Can't panic and do improv at once.
Venmo me. Science.

27
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:32,295
You coming Thursday? You're kinda on
the team now.

28
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:34,776
…Yeah. I'll be there.

29
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:39,652
<i>Two lies. Still saved him a seat.</i>

30
00:01:40,150 --> 00:01:42,298
<i>On the team. On the list.</i>

31
00:01:48,150 --> 00:01:49,433
You don't have to sign it tonight.

32
00:01:49,553 --> 00:01:50,191
I know.

33
00:01:53,150 --> 00:01:55,826
<i>Eight years. Never seen him scared.</i>

34
00:01:56,400 --> 00:02:00,631
<i>Don't sign, Grant signs. And he won't
stop at two hundred.</i>
